Rule 3 (for all dimensions d != dim, index.size(d) <= input.size(d))
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if i ≠ v_2 then shape(v_3, i) ≤ shape(v_1, i)
